# Held-local gate-14 reference captures — eulerian-smoke 3D Taylor-Green
# (128³, step-500, ~738 MB each). Deliberately NOT committed per D13/D14
# (LFS-bandwidth conservation); their sha256 digests are recorded in the
# eulerian-smoke-stack-{d,e} audits. Ignored to de-clutter `git status`
# (cleanup §13 #24); these are intentional held-local artifacts, NOT stray
# junk — remove the matching line if a future operator routing commits them.
captures/eulerian-smoke-stack-d/taylor-green-128cube-seed42-step500.*
captures/eulerian-smoke-stack-e/taylor-green-128cube-seed42-step500.*

# common-3dgs 3dgs-smoke local render outputs (PNG/HDF5/PLY). The canonical
# capture is committed to the schema-corpus at tests/fixtures/legacy-captures/;
# the examples/smoke_3dgs/out/ dir is a scratch render target.
common/common-3dgs/examples/smoke_3dgs/out/
